# Bouwens et al. (2022), ApJ 940, 55 (arXiv:2205.11526), Table 4: binned rest-frame UV LF of lensed galaxies behind the six HFF clusters
# Lensing companion of Bouwens et al. (2021) (blank fields + HUDF + HFF parallels; entry Bouwens2021)
# Redshift: z~6 dropout sample (HFF cluster fields)
# x: M_1600,AB (intrinsic, de-lensed)
# Phi: linear Phi in Mpc^-3 mag^-1 (H0=70, Om=0.3); asymmetric 1-sigma errors (upper, lower)
